sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Aspergillus nidulans Turing onset wavelength at 12.84 µm (nominal 13 µm), Holocene 0 Ma — MorphoEval overall 88.1/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2. The three pass-1 gaps are closed: three seeds lock to 12.84 µm (CV about 0 against a 0.05 reference), 12-bin Sobel orientation L1 is 0.014 against a ramp null of 1.81, and the alpha sweep is exported. Dispersion Pearson remains 0.9977. The spiral colony is still a measured carrier, not an ab-initio prediction. Nanopubs are unsigned. Overall 88.1/100 (faithfulness 86.7, reproducibility 91.5); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 67f1491da9b5137f7d8845c371d3acf6d72c7479; environment: python 3.12, numpy 2.5.4, matplotlib Agg, Pillow 13.0.0, scipy 1.18.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 88, Morphological realism / specimen match 82, Parameter expressivity 91, Morphometric validation 90, Source and data traceability 92, Code-to-model traceability 90, Reproducibility package 92. Output judged: docs/media/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 67f1491da9b5137f7d8845c371d3acf6d72c7479, image/png, 275906 B, 1440×960 px, artifact_sha256 44bf1efce2b3c4b56ac56b363db0b1a0461956f82bb4a0ba2539fd98e6ec63bd (sha256 44bf1efce2b3c4b56ac56b363db0b1a0461956f82bb4a0ba2539fd98e6ec63bd), spec_fingerprint 8c34b8958cd42958d8cb0eb69ec1584db47478aa1296bac845f8f594052484e9. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 8c34b8958cd42958d8cb0eb69ec1584db47478aa1296bac845f8f594052484e9; artifact_sha256: 44bf1efce2b3c4b56ac56b363db0b1a0461956f82bb4a0ba2539fd98e6ec63bd; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=6b16f2c6f118230e..., datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0_specimen.jpg=282a45a621880a69...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing (1952): diffusion-driven instability and a critical wavenumber. | Schnakenberg (1979): the a - u + u^2 v / b - u^2 v kinetics. | Adams, Wieser and Yu (1998) and Clutterbuck (1969): conidial pigment development in A. nidulans, without a reaction-diffusion wavelength. | Trinci (1974): radial hyphal-colony expansion.; reconstructed_in_script: Jacobian, onset k_c, periodic explicit Euler, equal-diffusion ablation, and D_v sweep. | Three-seed wavelength CV under ±2% wavenumber jitter, and 12-bin Sobel orientation L1 against a horizontal-ramp null. | Colony observable I = S * (1 - α + α (0.55 + 0.90 û)), α swept and exported.; transfer_boundary: The 13 µm label is the slot detail scale (1.284e-05 m). The colony photograph does not resolve 13 µm. | (u, v) are not the wA or yA gene products.; does_not_claim: Does not claim the spiral colony was predicted ab initio. | Does not claim a predecessor chronospecies. Series 1/1 at 0 Ma; the spatial comparison is the 10 µm tier floor. | Nanopublications are not signed: ~/.nanopub/profile.yml is absent.." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:hasScore "0.881"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 (Cursor cloud agent, primary assessor, pass 2)" ;
        dct:identifier "grok-4.7" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://x.ai> .
}

